  nl      = "PPO asymptotic performance saturates as parallel environments increase (plateau around 25k envs), due to redundant IID samples from a shared Gaussian policy; the sweep spans ~1500 to 100000 environments (4x beyond the threshold) on Shadow Hand and Allegro Kuka Throw over >= 3 seeds, and SAPG exceeds the PPO plateau on the same tasks"
